OL,3,AMore than 100 arrested in French
OL,4,Aprotests, as interior ministry condemns
OL,5,A'targeted acts of violence'
OL,6,
OL,7,FMore than 100 people have been arrested
OL,8,Facross France, with tens of thousands
OL,9,Fexpected at protests against rising
OL,10,Ffuel prices and the cost of living
OL,12,FThe French interior ministry condemns
OL,13,Fwhat it calls "targeted acts of
OL,14,Fviolence" and accuses some protesters
OL,15,Fof attempts at looting and attacks on
OL,16,Fpolice
OL,18,FA major demonstration is scheduled in
OL,19,FParis for 14:00 local time (13:00 BST)
OL,20,F- you can watch live above
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
