OL,3,AMore than 100 arrested in French
OL,4,Aprotests, as interior ministry condemns
OL,5,A'targeted acts of violence'
OL,6,
OL,7,FProtesters are hyped up and we're
OL,8,Fhearing constant chants calling for
OL,9,FPresident Macron to resign, writes our
OL,10,Fcorrespondent in Paris
OL,12,FToday's demonstrations come after three
OL,13,Fweeks of student protests across the
OL,14,Fcountry, with calls for students to be
OL,15,Fjoined by workers' unions and key
OL,16,Ffigures from the so-called "yellow
OL,17,Fvest" movement
OL,19,FFrench President Emmanuel Macron has
OL,20,Fappealed for "calm", calling on
OL,21,Fdemonstrators to show "respect for
OL,22,Fpeople and property"
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
